id: desperate-dodge
name: Desperate Dodge
uaType: technical
prerequisite: Agility Score 4+
tpCost: 8
type: counter
actionCost: 1
kiCost: 0
# "If an Opponent would use the Exploit Maneuver in response to you triggering it, before any Counter Actions are spent
# or the Maneuver is actually used, make a Clash (Impulsive/Corporeal) against that Opponent." Offered beside the
# Exploit it answers (chat.mjs desperateDodge): while its Clash is out the Exploit waits, and won it is gone.
dodgesExploits: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  A Counter against an Exploit you triggered: win a Clash (Impulsive/Corporeal) and you did not trigger it. Passive:
  Diminishing Defense's penalty 1 lower, and 1 more every 2 Base Tiers after the first.
text: >
  Desperate Dodge: You twist out of the way of an exploitative attack at the last possible second.
  –Ability Type: Technical
  –Prerequisites: Agility Score 4+
  –TP Cost: 8
  –KP Cost: N/A
  –Maneuver Type: Counter
  –Action Cost: 1 Counter Action
  –Minions: N/A
  –Passive Bonus: Reduce your total penalties from Diminishing Defense by 1 (increasing by 1 every 2 base Tier of Power
  reached after the first).
  –Effect: If an Opponent would use the Exploit Maneuver in response to you triggering it, before any Counter Actions
  are spent or the Maneuver is actually used, make a Clash (Impulsive/Corporeal) against that Opponent. If you win, you
  do not trigger that Exploit Maneuver (and therefore they do not use it).

---

# "Reduce your total penalties from Diminishing Defense by 1 (increasing by 1 every 2 base Tier of Power reached after
# the first)" - 1 at Base Tier 1 and 2, 2 at 3 and 4, and so on.
[passive]
diminishing.defense.reduction += 1 + floor((1(bT) - 1) / 2);
